# Golden pixel fixtures: raw RGBA bytes, compared byte for byte by
# tests/pixel/templates.spec.ts. They must never be touched on the way in or
# out — a CRLF checkout would make all 18 goldens mismatch for a reason that
# has nothing to do with the renderer, and the suite's advice ("decide whether
# this is a regression or a deliberate change") would be actively misleading.
# (`**`, not a trailing slash: a directory pattern does not recurse in an
# attributes file the way it does in .gitignore.)
tests/pixel/__screenshots__/** binary
